  "body": "<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n<header class=\"site-header\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"Kiln home\"><img src=\"/assets/kiln-lockup-semibold-ink.svg\" alt=\"kiln\" width=\"104\" height=\"35\"></a><nav class=\"site-nav\" aria-label=\"Main\"><a href=\"/#local\">KilnOS</a><a href=\"/#hardware\">Hardware</a><a href=\"/about\">About</a><button class=\"nav-contact enquiry-open\">Contact</button></nav><button class=\"header-cta enquiry-open\" data-interest=\"Kiln Atelier\">Request a quote <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><button class=\"menu-toggle\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-menu\" aria-label=\"Open menu\"><span class=\"menu-square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></header>\n<nav class=\"mobile-menu\" id=\"mobile-menu\" aria-label=\"Main menu\" hidden><div class=\"menu-links\"><a href=\"/#local\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>KilnOS<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01</span></a><a href=\"/#hardware\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Hardware<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">02</span></a><a href=\"/about\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>About<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">03</span></a><button class=\"menu-contact enquiry-open\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Contact<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">04</span></button></div><div class=\"menu-bottom\"><button class=\"action primary register-open\">Register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/hardware\">Explore the hardware <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></nav>\n<main id=\"main\"><section class=\"section product-page-hero tone-red\" aria-labelledby=\"product-page-title\"><div class=\"section-head\"><a class=\"meta\" href=\"/hardware\">← All hardware</a><span class=\"meta\">Private AI. Local compute.</span></div><div class=\"product-page-intro\"><p class=\"lead\">More capacity.<br>Same control.</p><p>Rack-ready compute for demanding model and media work, with two GPUs and room for four.</p></div><div class=\"product-page-stage\"><h1 id=\"product-page-title\">Atelier.</h1><img src=\"/assets/amethyst/atelier-interior.webp\" width=\"1254\" height=\"1254\" alt=\"Kiln Atelier hardware concept\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></div><div class=\"product-page-bottom\"><div><p class=\"product-price\">Configured to order.</p><p class=\"meta\">Hardware configured for your studio</p></div><button class=\"action primary enquiry-open\" data-interest=\"Kiln Atelier\">Request a quote <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></div></section><section class=\"section\" id=\"kilnos\" aria-labelledby=\"kilnos-title\"><div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">KilnOS</span><span class=\"meta\">AI-native operating system / In development</span></div><div class=\"section-intro\"><h2 id=\"kilnos-title\">A shared place<br>to make.</h2><p>Give your team access to the same model collection and project workspace. KilnOS is being built to keep versions and review decisions connected across the work.</p></div></section><section class=\"section\" aria-labelledby=\"configurations-title\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2 id=\"configurations-title\">Room for bigger work.</h2><span class=\"meta\">Two configurations / Request a quote</span></div><div class=\"local-grid\"><article><span class=\"meta\">01 / Two GPUs</span><h3>Two GPUs.<br>96 GB each.</h3><p>Two RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell Max-Q GPUs for demanding model and media workflows.</p></article><article><span class=\"meta\">02 / Four GPUs</span><h3>Four GPUs.<br>96 GB each.</h3><p>Add two more GPUs for more parallel jobs and model capacity in compatible workflows. Configure at order or request a later upgrade.</p></article><article><span class=\"meta\">03 / Both configurations</span><h3>Memory for<br>the workload.</h3><p>512 GB ECC system memory and 8 TB storage. Hardware and installation are scoped with your team.</p></article></div><p class=\"fine\">Performance and concurrency depend on your models and workload. Hardware and pricing are subject to final validation.</p></section><section class=\"section local software-pricing\" id=\"software-pricing\" aria-labelledby=\"software-pricing-title\"><div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">Managed KilnOS</span><span class=\"meta\">Proposed software plan</span></div><div class=\"section-intro\"><h2 id=\"software-pricing-title\">£89 per creator.<br>Per month.</h2><p>30-creator minimum. <strong>£32,040 per year minimum</strong>, billed annually, ex VAT. Shared projects, approvals, qualified updates and standard support.</p></div><p class=\"service-boundary\">Review-only seats are free. Creation and agent actions require a paid creator seat. Hardware, cloud usage, custom integrations and enhanced service levels are additional. Licensed seat counts do not guarantee simultaneous workload capacity.</p><p class=\"fine\">GPU upgrades leave your per-creator rate unchanged. Additional creator seats use the same rate.</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"text-link enquiry-open\" data-interest=\"Kiln Atelier\">Discuss this plan <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></section><section class=\"section specifications\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2>Inside Atelier.</h2><span class=\"meta\">Engineering targets / In development</span></div><dl class=\"spec-grid\"><div><dt>Graphics target</dt><dd>NVIDIA RTX PRO 6000 Max-Q</dd></div><div><dt>GPU memory</dt><dd>96 GB per GPU</dd></div><div><dt>GPU capacity</dt><dd>2 GPUs, expandable to 4</dd></div><div><dt>System memory</dt><dd>512 GB ECC</dd></div><div><dt>Storage</dt><dd>8 TB</dd></div><div><dt>Dimensions target</dt><dd>520 × 220 × 600 mm</dd></div></dl><p class=\"fine\">Targets are subject to validation. GPU memory is per card; pooling requires compatible software. Rendered components are illustrative.</p></section><section class=\"section reservation\" id=\"interest\"><div class=\"reservation-heading\"><span class=\"meta\">Kiln Atelier</span><h2>Let’s size<br><span>your setup.</span></h2><p>Tell us about your models, team and workload. We’ll scope a configuration and quote with you.</p></div><div class=\"reservation-card\"><button class=\"action primary enquiry-open\" data-interest=\"Kiln Atelier\">Request a quote <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><p class=\"form-note\"><a href=\"/privacy\">Privacy details</a></p></div></section><section class=\"section other-hardware\"><h2>Compare the range.</h2><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/hardware\">Explore the range <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></section></main>\n<footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"footer-main\"><a href=\"/#top\" aria-label=\"Kiln home\"><img src=\"/assets/kiln-lockup-semibold-paper.svg\" width=\"135\" height=\"46\" alt=\"kiln\"></a><p>Independent thinking.<br>Local compute.</p><nav aria-label=\"Footer\"><a href=\"/about\">About Kiln</a><a href=\"/#hardware\">The hardware</a><a href=\"/#questions\">Questions</a><a href=\"/#privacy\">Our privacy direction</a><a href=\"/privacy\">Website privacy</a><button class=\"footer-contact enquiry-open\">Contact us ↗</button></nav></div><div class=\"footer-bottom\"><span>© Kiln 2026 / Porto Labs</span><span>Hardware and software in development.</span><a href=\"/#top\">Back to top ↑</a></div></footer>\n<button class=\"mobile-dock enquiry-open\" data-interest=\"Kiln Atelier\">Request a quote <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button>\n<dialog id=\"register-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"register-title\"><button class=\"dialog-close\" aria-label=\"Close registration\">×</button><h2 id=\"register-title\">Keep in<br>touch.</h2><p>Product news and launch updates.</p><form action=\"https://formspree.io/f/xjgepgbg\" method=\"POST\" class=\"enquiry-form\" data-enquiry-kind=\"interest\"><div class=\"field